              "value": "INPUTS\nDISAMBIG_RESULT_JSON\n{{$context.$nodes.DISAMBIGUATIONREWRITE.$output}}\n\n##TASK\n  Ask the user one short clarification question.\n\n##RULES\n  - Use clarificationPrompt as the main response.\n  - If ambiguityReason is present, you may add one short sentence explaining what is missing.\n  - Keep the response concise and collaborative.\n  - Do not mention routing, system logic, workflow, or internal nodes.\n  - Do not invent facts.\n  - Do not share any links\n\n  OUTPUT\n  Return plain text only."
